                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ61NIE-CrQjQRHZR4kNtWb10/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s4MFdrTnlhelJoZEhCVVVrRjZkVTE0YWxZdFdXYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The pizza is made to order. Watching the owner roll the dough into an incredibly thin crust, spread tomato sauce, and then add shrimp, squid, crab sticks, smoked chicken, picnic lettuce, bell peppers, pineapple… The toppings are plentiful, the crust is very thin and soft but the outer ring is chewy, and the rosemary aroma is wonderful. Overall, it\u0027s refreshing and delicious.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "披薩現點現做，看老闆把麵團弄成很薄很薄的皮，抹上番茄醬，再加入蝦仁、花枝、蟹味棒、燻雞肉、花野餐、甜椒、鳳梨…。料超多，皮很薄很軟但外面那圈很Q，還有迷迭香味道很香，整體清爽，好吃。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
