                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ61NIE-CrQjQRHZR4kNtWb10/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKallrcHpiVFJsVFhWME9Wb3pWRWRMYVhSdWNHYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "7 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Tired of Pizza Hut in Naples, I wanted to try a professional wood-fired pizza. I searched on Google and tried this place for the first time.\n\nThe owner was very nice; he made it for me even without a reservation, and it was super fast—only 15 minutes! I finished mine in about 15 minutes too 😋\n\nFreshly baked pizza is amazing 👍 and it had the thin crust I was looking for, with plenty of toppings—the kind that practically fall apart when you pick it up! So satisfying. Next time I\u0027ll try other flavors.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "必勝客拿波里吃膩了，想試試專業窯烤披薩，查google第一次試這家\n老闆人很好，沒預訂直接幫我現做，超級快15分鐘就好了！我也差不多15分鐘就吃完了😋\n\n現烤的披薩就是讚👍而且是我在尋找的薄皮，餡料滿滿，拿起來會掉的那種，有夠滿足。下次試試其他口味",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
